GXEMUL-SEC/regress/sh4_pcic_probe.py:222:    """One cold-debugger session.  Returns (buf, alive, started).
GXEMUL-SEC/regress/sh4_pcic_probe.py:223:
GXEMUL-SEC/regress/sh4_pcic_probe.py:224:    `started` is kept separate from `alive` ON PURPOSE.  A session that never
